{"id":"e54ec33f2a2eb02c129c9445d4e315e464f7194a","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1244416","title":"你们多少人是自费订阅 ai 用在工作上的？","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"libasten","excerpt":"职场话题 - @libasten - 就是为了多点摸鱼时间？","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"Main\">\n                \n                \n<div>\n        \n        <p>就是为了多点摸鱼时间？</p>\n        \n    </div>\n\n<!-- SOL tip topic -->\n\n\n\n\n\n<div>\n    <div><P><a href=\"/tag/自费\"><li></li> 自费</a><a href=\"/tag/工作\"><li></li> 工作</a><a href=\"/tag/摸鱼\"><li></li> 摸鱼</a></P><p><span>73 replies &#160;<strong>•</strong> &#160;2026-09-25 00:40:13 +08:00</span>\n    </p></div>\n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18122089\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/b36b/3df5/748865_normal.png?m=1749550471\" alt=\"GopFei\" data-uid=\"748865\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>5</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/GopFei\">GopFei</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-24 09:40:54 +08:00\">20h 46m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>+1 公司不报，那就是我自己的工作量，省下来的时间摸鱼不香么。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18122136\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/7624630ff4f2bad517fe23a0f81daf6b?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"csfreshman\" data-uid=\"537477\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>6</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/csfreshman\">csfreshman</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-24 09:45:19 +08:00\">20h 42m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>+1 公司只报销 200,我开了 cc 和 codex ，自费 100 以内，公司内部有 deepseek 自部署的，基本上随便用，人多的时候巨慢。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18122166\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/656995fd368d55f10dfd29616fc8bd2b?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"mit66\" data-uid=\"504708\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>7</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/mit66\">mit66</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-24 09:48:38 +08:00\">20h 38m ago via Android</span> \n                    \n                    <p>+1 ，开了 20pro ，真的节省很多时间和精力</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18122176\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/1b24/14be/387871_normal.png?m=1789001145\" alt=\"User839275\" data-uid=\"387871\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>8</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/User839275\">User839275</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-24 09:49:02 +08:00\">20h 38m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>gpt 5x 和 Claude 5x ，每个月肉疼，开发了很多插件，提升了很多效率，但是并没有多休息，工作是干不完的，差不多就下班吧</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18122219\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/463d/5100/539761_normal.png?m=1711527080\" alt=\"VersionGod1\" data-uid=\"539761\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>10</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/VersionGod1\">VersionGod1</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-24 09:53:25 +08:00\">20h 33m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>+1 ，有了 AI 就不想自己手敲代码了，公司不报销也得开</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18122291\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/3b645c4046a50f731ff2991d4dd03b12?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"absolutezz\" data-uid=\"731981\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>12</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/absolutezz\">absolutezz</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-24 10:01:35 +08:00\">20h 25m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>+1 ，工作量翻 n 倍了，公司提供 token 但是还会你暗示用多了，只能自己开订阅了。但 plus 会员用 sol 中或者 luna 写的代码确实不如我写的，偶尔想念古法编程按摩大脑，抚平褶皱 <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://i.imgur.com/agAJ0Rd.png\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/agAJ0Rd.png\" rel=\"noreferrer\"></a></p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18122348\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/3edbc3b933443b5246a007f1e55b2821?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"jioswu\" data-uid=\"207044\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>13</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/jioswu\">jioswu</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-24 10:06:42 +08:00\">20h 20m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>一直自费上班,有了 AI 基本都不想手敲代码了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18122561\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/57b94f7f153f3745286c0b8db7131786?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"layxy\" data-uid=\"428568\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>15</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/layxy\">layxy</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-24 10:27:23 +08:00\">20 hrs ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>+1,不过公司基于 codex 开发了个，模型国内外各家都有，后续就不用自费上班了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18122660\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/bda7ca9aa4308a060964140c2e42d0a4?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"connor123\" data-uid=\"577349\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>16</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/connor123\">connor123</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-24 10:35:42 +08:00\">19h 51m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>虽然公司不买 ai ，但是业务部门以及产品经理，都在卯足了劲的提需求，不用 ai 根本干不完，唉，被迫卷起来了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18122716\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/6dc94c49c8482052672fc2e51f201bd2?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"tommyshelbyV2\" data-uid=\"650379\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>17</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/tommyshelbyV2\">tommyshelbyV2</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-24 10:40:22 +08:00\">19h 47m ago</span>  &#160; <span><img src=\"/static/img/heart_20250818.png?v=c3415183a0b3e9ab1576251be69d7d6d\" width=\"14\" alt=\"❤️\"> 3</span>\n                    \n                    <p>1000+了，不过我不叫他订阅，我叫他外包模式，自动升级为包工头。跟之前一个海外新闻很像，一个大厂的员工把工作外包给了国内的程序员 <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://i.imgur.com/agAJ0Rd.png\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/agAJ0Rd.png\" rel=\"noreferrer\"></a></p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18122748\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/212f/028f/677645_normal.png?m=1785891322\" alt=\"dododook\" data-uid=\"677645\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>18</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/dododook\">dododook</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-24 10:43:47 +08:00\">19h 43m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>+1 ，公司提倡使用 AI ，但是没说报销··</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18122798\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/bab9bca41993335dec729696223b5c91?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"peterHi\" data-uid=\"355758\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>19</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/peterHi\">peterHi</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-24 10:50:15 +08:00\">19h 37m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>+1,但是报给公司的工时是不用 AI 的工时</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18122845\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/a326/0df4/477906_normal.png?m=1787193962\" alt=\"lgc931018\" data-uid=\"477906\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>20</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/lgc931018\">lgc931018</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-24 10:54:58 +08:00\">19h 32m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>之前公司没买 我就用白嫖的 现在公司买了两个 Codex 20 团队用 就用公司的 白嫖的就自己用</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18122906\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/913c/4d10/155970_normal.png?m=1729838514\" alt=\"miracleyao\" data-uid=\"155970\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>21</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/miracleyao\">miracleyao</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-24 11:00:40 +08:00\">19h 26m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>+1 ，公司开了国内模型，我自己跟朋友拼车订阅了 GPT 和 Grok 。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18123125\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/efe3e3240b4e0011ca8376aee28af199?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"cvbnt\" data-uid=\"100968\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>23</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/cvbnt\">cvbnt</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-24 11:24:07 +08:00\">19h 3m ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <p>freebuff ，opencode ，cline 三家免费 API 用都用不完，工作上狠狠用，个人项目就要上 gpt 了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18123257\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/7624630ff4f2bad517fe23a0f81daf6b?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"csfreshman\" data-uid=\"537477\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>24</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/csfreshman\">csfreshman</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-24 11:40:10 +08:00\">18h 47m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/cvbnt\">cvbnt</a> 免费的没这么多吧，freebuff 和 opencode 我也有，不顶用呀，cline 没听说过</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18123270\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/0994/f3ff/136802_normal.png?m=1715333876\" alt=\"wombat\" data-uid=\"136802\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>25</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/wombat\">wombat</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-24 11:42:08 +08:00\">18h 45m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>公司内部提供额度，但不如自己订阅的好用。 现在每个月 1k+了，主要为了偷懒。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18123286\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/7b1432fd9577a14116e3971df74c876b?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"giter\" data-uid=\"476845\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>26</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/giter\">giter</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-24 11:44:42 +08:00\">18h 42m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>主要自己也要开发个人项目，反正 token 也有余量用不完，挪给公司项目使用反倒能提升效率增加摸鱼时间。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18123353\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/acd6/85e6/497030_normal.png?m=1783483367\" alt=\"WaldenHorizon\" data-uid=\"497030\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>28</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/WaldenHorizon\">WaldenHorizon</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-24 11:55:07 +08:00\">18h 32m ago</span>  &#160; <span><img src=\"/static/img/heart_20250818.png?v=c3415183a0b3e9ab1576251be69d7d6d\" width=\"14\" alt=\"❤️\"> 1</span>\n                    \n                    <p>同时好几个项目，公司和私活都有，自费 claude 200 刀<br>不过 opus5.5 的出现，让我考虑降到 100 刀了，真是又强又便宜</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18123392\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/efe3e3240b4e0011ca8376aee28af199?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"cvbnt\" data-uid=\"100968\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>30</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/cvbnt\">cvbnt</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-24 12:01:14 +08:00\">18h 26m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/csfreshman\">csfreshman</a> #24 freebuff 如果你切美国 IP 有更多免费的额度，opencode 的额度是免费池，每个区域的池子不一样，也是可以通过切换 IP 就能解决，cline 的免费模型也是按天刷新，不同的是模型额度分开，比如 ds 今天额度用完，可以继续用 glm5.3 的额度</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18123480\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/1f8195531c63cdc0bc4e6b246c842f5c?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"bencool\" data-uid=\"460318\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>31</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/bencool\">bencool</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-24 12:24:34 +08:00\">18h 2m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>如果自己轻松了，还是值得花的。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18123500\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/d30b/8fb4/90818_normal.png?m=1720835206\" alt=\"panlatent\" data-uid=\"90818\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>33</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/panlatent\">panlatent</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-24 12:32:17 +08:00\">17h 55m ago via Android</span> \n                    \n                    <p>这么看每个月给我报 1000 还算好的了（按 pro 20 算）。 不过这并不是公司仁慈，而是我用 ai 产出够多 🤦‍♂️</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18123792\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/2bc7ce8d9acad7998eb4aa1ecfa137d5?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"polo3584\" data-uid=\"362469\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>36</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/polo3584\">polo3584</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-24 13:43:17 +08:00\">16h 44m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>+1 ，每个月也就 80 土区 gpt</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18123959\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/822b/2f2f/492708_normal.png?m=1757313712\" alt=\"EliStone\" data-uid=\"492708\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>37</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/EliStone\">EliStone</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-24 14:05:21 +08:00\">16h 22m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>公司提供 GPT + 国内模型，自己买了 claude pro ，够用了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18124023\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/d6ca/4972/312242_normal.png?m=1780449117\" alt=\"Sezxy\" data-uid=\"312242\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>40</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Sezxy\">Sezxy</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-24 14:12:01 +08:00\">16h 15m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>0 ，公司无限量提供</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18124183\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/cb7e/d3ff/714531_normal.png?m=1761119463\" alt=\"V2Try\" data-uid=\"714531\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>43</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/V2Try\">V2Try</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-24 14:31:03 +08:00\">15h 56m ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <p>两个 20 刀的最顶级大厂的乞丐套餐，codex 的 debug 能力很强，Claude 实现需求的能力很强。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n       