?m=1767773762\" alt=\"lewurui\" data-uid=\"336067\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>65</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/lewurui\">lewurui</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-24 17:36:02 +08:00\">12h 51m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>下各种客户端签到白嫖 + deepseek api 每月不超过 50</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18125562\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/ceba67eec3445637aae1f09e5eabe0d8?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"Jeepeng\" data-uid=\"118812\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>67</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Jeepeng\">Jeepeng</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-24 18:00:37 +08:00\">12h 26m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>自费开了 Codex Plus （主力，活多时开 Pro 5x ）、Cursor （年费）、Antigravity （年费）</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18125635\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/006ad46747365bec4593d626cb6f5eb0?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"nuo7mi7\" data-uid=\"671403\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>68</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/nuo7mi7\">nuo7mi7</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-24 18:25:28 +08:00\">12h 1m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>每月 Cursor 500 刀的额度，感觉都不够用</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18125761\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/a832291822cd2c05125a29c13496408f?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"goongjl\" data-uid=\"461487\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>69</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/goongjl\">goongjl</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-24 19:32:16 +08:00\">10h 55m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>公司每月报销 3500 ，差不多够开 3 个 200 刀的 codex 。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18126010\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/de31/6fb5/44664_normal.png?m=1495650798\" alt=\"flowerains\" data-uid=\"44664\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>70</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/flowerains\">flowerains</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-24 22:16:18 +08:00\">8h 11m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>公司没报销，订阅的 ds 4.1flash ，但是人用的多了，体感吐词太慢了，还没个人订阅的快</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18126074\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/541b/1aeb/354793_normal.png?m=1761744857\" alt=\"charslee013\" data-uid=\"354793\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>71</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/charslee013\">charslee013</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-24 23:03:32 +08:00\">7h 23m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>+1 。活是按 AI 排期的，钱是烧自己的，锅是挑幸运儿背的，唯有 KPI 倒成了某些人手里的令箭。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18126109\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/131e/6517/678538_normal.png?m=1788846499\" alt=\"gurachin\" data-uid=\"678538\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>72</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/gurachin\">gurachin</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-24 23:23:59 +08:00\">7h 3m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>200 左右。省下时间自己摸鱼啥的不好吗？一个月能省下两天工时就是大赢特赢了。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18126206\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/c423/063b/373912_normal.png?m=1701056609\" alt=\"coolmint\" data-uid=\"373912\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>73</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/coolmint\">coolmint</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-25 00:40:13 +08:00\">5h 47m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>无法想象竟然这么多公司不报销，前两天跟就职于快手的朋友吃饭，快手竟然都不管，我服了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n            </div></DIV>","content_text":"就是为了多点摸鱼时间？ 自费 工作 摸鱼73 replies • 2026-09-25 00:40:13 +08:00 5 GopFei 20h 46m ago +1 公司不报，那就是我自己的工作量，省下来的时间摸鱼不香么。 6 csfreshman 20h 42m ago +1 公司只报销 200,我开了 cc 和 codex ，自费 100 以内，公司内部有 deepseek 自部署的，基本上随便用，人多的时候巨慢。 7 mit66 20h 38m ago via Android +1 ，开了 20pro ，真的节省很多时间和精力 8 User839275 20h 38m ago gpt 5x 和 Claude 5x ，每个月肉疼，开发了很多插件，提升了很多效率，但是并没有多休息，工作是干不完的，差不多就下班吧 10 VersionGod1 20h 33m ago +1 ，有了 AI 就不想自己手敲代码了，公司不报销也得开 12 absolutezz 20h 25m ago +1 ，工作量翻 n 倍了，公司提供 token 但是还会你暗示用多了，只能自己开订阅了。但 plus 会员用 sol 中或者 luna 写的代码确实不如我写的，偶尔想念古法编程按摩大脑，抚平褶皱 13 jioswu 20h 20m ago 一直自费上班,有了 AI 基本都不想手敲代码了 15 layxy 20 